        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Album Art from a Mood\n\nGenerates square cover art from a mood description. The 1:1 aspect ratio matches what streaming platforms display, so the image needs no cropping.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Prompt\" describes a single stark object on a deep colour field with grainy film texture. \"2 Generate\" renders it at 1:1 and 1K resolution. \"3 Image\" shows the cover.\n\n**Try this:** Pick a model on \"2 Generate\" and rewrite the prompt for your record, for example a neon-lit street at dawn in muted blues."
